+| 5 | `0x72e4f9f808c49a2a61de9c5896298920dc4eeea9` | BITCOIN | **8** | 8 | `{"decimals":8}` | 18 |
+| 6 | `0x14fee680690900ba0cccfc76ad70fd1b95d10e16` | $PAAL | **9** | 9 | `{"decimals":9}` | 18 |
